    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Othello (Reversi) Let's Go</i></strong> is a highly-acclaimed strategy board game for all ages. It takes a minute to learn and a lifetime to master!<br><br><strong><i>Four</i></strong> different game modes are available for you to play:<br><u><strong>Classic Solo</strong></u><br>World class AI with 8 difficulty levels, suits for both beginners and advanced players.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/0898f0418d22191d8e6399749e871356.poster.avif?t=1666989743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/0898f0418d22191d8e6399749e871356.webm?t=1666989743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/0898f0418d22191d8e6399749e871356.mp4?t=1666989743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u>Endgame Challenge</u></strong><br>Solve 80 carefully selected endgame puzzles. Give it a try and show yourself you are a truly Othello master.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/64230996bd8a33b5ae78ff431bdc48fe.avif?t=1666989743\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Lights Out</u></strong><br>Classic electronic game, Lights Out. Can you flip all pieces to black on the board? <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/aeb5ad901bfe5886bf16039a5ea15821.poster.avif?t=1666989743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/aeb5ad901bfe5886bf16039a5ea15821.webm?t=1666989743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1256490/extras/aeb5ad901bfe5886bf16039a5ea15821.mp4?t=1666989743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong>Local co-op for Two Players</strong></u><br>Do play with your family and friends!",
